  "DescIdentified": {
    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "id": 13776,
      "0": "Grace flows into every stride, as if the hide itself was born for the dance of blades. It turns a skirmish into a fluid motion, shielding the body against the harshest points of a spear. A masterwork of Isengard, it offers a shadow's protection to those who move with lethal intent."
    }
  },
  "Description": {
    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "Supple hide is cured to mold closely against the body, allowing for fluid movement without the constraint of bulk. The leather bears the faint scuffs of many skirmishes, remaining soft yet resilient against the skin."
    }
  },
